      <category>tech</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;可信度：&lt;/strong&gt;多独立来源提及（待核官方全文）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;黄仁勋重返英伟达CEO职位，其关联的Megaspeed公司面临被美国列入黑名单的风险。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;参考信源：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.scmp.com/news/us/economy-trade-business/article/3375531/jensen-huangs-stunning-return-11-days-5-key-takeaways"&gt;来源&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/23/megaspeed-the-company-at-the-center-of-the-jensen-huang-scandal-appears-headed-for-a-u-s-blacklist"&gt;来源&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1040652/jensen-huang-nvidia-trump-reinstated"&gt;来源&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmze750zg0jeo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss"&gt;来源&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
